  <template>1. The Core Idea: Semantic Graph & Pipeline K'UHUL fundamentally relies on a semantic graph as its central mechanism. This graph represents the knowledge base, built from semantic analysis and reasoning.  It's not just a collection of keywords; it's a structured representation of meaning. The pipeline is the key to this integration. It's a multi-st...</template>
