  <pattern>WHAT ARE THE BENEFITS OF USING KUHULS REASONING ENGINE COMPARED TO TRADITIONAL QUERY PROCESSING</pattern>
  <template>1. O(n+m+z) Complexity: This is the *key* differentiator. Traditional query processing often relies on linear time complexity (O(n)), where 'n' is the number of keys and 'm' is the number of matches. K'UHUL's engine, however, achieves a complexity of O(n+m+z), where 'z' is the number of *graph nodes* (the nodes in the graph). This is a *massive* im...</template>
